                                                "sense_id": "0bf235f5-e13d-3547-bb52-852a7c525fab",
                                                "text": "Watching him, Dorrigo Evans wondered if it was avitaminosis or the combined damage of several maladies that had done this—whatever the cause, he was painfully aware that food would cure this and almost all of the afflictions he saw."
